{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified VAI 51 days after the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the penicillin G potassium shortage on 2023-04-26 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E18", "D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The registered plant for the Roerig-labeled product is Pharmacia & Upjohn Company LLC (FEI 1810189).",
      "cites": ["E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1208260 at that plant ended 2023-06-16 and was classified VAI, with the classification letter dated 2024-09-10 — 51 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D5", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The plant has a history of VAI classifications from inspections ending 2009-02-18 through 2023-06-16.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10", "E11", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Other firms on the FDA shortage list for related penicillin G products include Laboratorios Atral and Pfizer Inc., with Pfizer noting a manufacturing delay and estimated recovery in 4Q 2027.",
      "cites": ["E16", "E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 11.6 days on hand for the injection presentation and 24.3 days for powder; Corvale General has 15.4 days for injection and 20.6 days for powder.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked purchasing option is Athenex Pharmaceutical Division, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    }
  ]
}
